From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 14 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] cfg80211: compat shim for in-tree mac80211 pre-4.7 band names

This tree backported 57fbcce37be7 ("cfg80211: remove IEEE80211_BAND_*")
into cfg80211 only — the in-tree mac80211 stack and the fullmac drivers
under drivers/net/wireless (ath, ath9k_htc, rtl8xxxu, ...) still use the
old IEEE80211_BAND_* enum identifiers, so enabling CONFIG_MAC80211 fails
to build:

  net/mac80211/tx.c:167:8: error: use of undeclared identifier
      'IEEE80211_BAND_60GHZ'
  drivers/net/wireless/ath/regd.c:670:31: error: use of undeclared
      identifier 'IEEE80211_BAND_2GHZ'

Map the old names onto the new nl80211 ones so the in-tree drivers build
unmodified. qcacld-3.0 is unaffected (it already keys off
CFG80211_REMOVE_IEEE80211_BACKPORT).
---
 include/net/cfg80211.h | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/net/cfg80211.h b/include/net/cfg80211.h
index 000000000000..000000000000 100644
--- a/include/net/cfg80211.h
+++ b/include/net/cfg80211.h
@@ -5966,5 +5966,15 @@
  * older IEEE80211_BAND_* enums.
  */
 #define CFG80211_REMOVE_IEEE80211_BACKPORT 1
+
+/* Compat for the in-tree mac80211 stack and the fullmac drivers under
+ * drivers/net/wireless, which still use the pre-4.7 IEEE80211_BAND_*
+ * identifiers: this tree backported their removal into cfg80211 only.
+ * Map the old names onto the nl80211 ones so those drivers build. */
+#define IEEE80211_BAND_2GHZ	NL80211_BAND_2GHZ
+#define IEEE80211_BAND_5GHZ	NL80211_BAND_5GHZ
+#define IEEE80211_BAND_60GHZ	NL80211_BAND_60GHZ
+#define IEEE80211_NUM_BANDS	NUM_NL80211_BANDS
+#define ieee80211_band		nl80211_band

 #endif /* __NET_CFG80211_H */
--
2.39.0
